            "content": "<p><strong>Your Pillow. Your Perfect Fit.</strong></p><p>No two sleepers are the same, so why should every pillow feel the same?</p><p>Our adjustable sleep pillow lets you create the height and comfort that feels right for you. Simply remove some of the soft filling for a lower profile, or keep it fuller for a more supportive feel.</p><p>Whether you sleep on your back, side or simply prefer a certain pillow height, you can easily fine-tune it to suit your personal comfort.</p><p>Because better sleep starts with a pillow that feels made for you.</p>",
